  <running_head>ET PRÆFATIO.</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">importuni sint? Effugium est certè</l>
    <l n="2">controversias in Ecclesia ortas tractari,</l>
    <l n="3">suosque errores notari, nolentium: ar-</l>
    <l n="4">tificium eorum qui, cùm in jus vocati</l>
    <l n="5">sint, actores se constituere niituntur.</l>
    <l n="6">Sive enim publico judicio, sive arbitrio</l>
    <l n="7">privato, causa agenda sit, ab ipso prin-</l>
    <l n="8">cipio id quod primò &amp; præcipuè con-</l>
    <l n="9">trovertitur, seriò rem cognosci volen-</l>
    <l n="10">tibus, ducendum exordium est; non</l>
    <l n="11">in postmodùm adnatis, ipso conten-</l>
    <l n="12">tionis progressu, contestationibus h-</l>
    <l n="13">ærendum.</l>
    <l n="14" para="true">Ideò</l>
    <l n="15">certè, quandocumque Ponti-</l>
    <l n="16">ficius quispiam, de Religionis contro-</l>
    <l n="17">versis capitibus nobiscum conferendi</l>
    <l n="18">avidum se contestatus, continuò de Ec-</l>
    <l n="19">clesia ejusque notis tractari petit; tum</l>
    <l n="20">fugere eum, &amp;, infirmitatis suæ con-</l>
    <l n="21">scientiâ, controversorum dogmatum</l>
    <l n="22">disquisitionem vitare jure interpretari</l>
    <l n="23">soleo. Si quis verò in Ecclesiæ nostræ</l>
    <l n="24">sinu educatus, hærere se &amp; in dubio esse</l>
    <l n="25">nobiscum perseverare, an ad Pontifi-</l>
    <l n="26">cios transire debeat, professus, eandem</l>
    <l n="27">illam serram reciprocet, &amp; de dogma-</l>
    <l n="28">tum veritate nihil quærens, de Ecclesia</l>
  </main_text>
  <notes />
</page>
